     _m_o_d is the module that starts the timer.  These timers are one-shot, they
     are not restarted.  Repeatable timers are started with
     ttiimmeerr__ssttaarrtt__rreeppeeaatt() which takes an additional argument _r_e_p_e_a_t___t_i_c_k_s.
